Subject: [PATCH] feat(v2): bind upstream Avalanche signatures to native
 payment coins

Maintenance explanation added during mailbox export:
Adapt pinned upstream Avalanche proof and response signatures to native V2 payment coin ownership and chain context. Native tests exercise stake authentication and protocol bindings; peer wire polling is not implemented by these adapters.

